 Cat's Eye sisters Hitomi, Rui, and Ai outwit Detective Toshio to steal the \"Roman Woman\".","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10817689/screencap/68d6a7d514d81.jpg"},{"title":"Memory of Dad","synopsis":"Hitomi pursues the painting \"A Girl from One Day,\" despite the extreme security and risks involved.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305351/screencap/690017d79265f.jpg"},{"title":"Difficult Love","synopsis":"Hitomi and Rui plan to steal from the Ohashi Museum of Art despite Ai's objections.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305352/screencap/690017ec76593.jpg"},{"title":"Night Flight Is a Dangerous Scent","synopsis":"Hitomi is concerned about their next heist, as Detective Asatani's suspicious gaze follows her.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305353/screencap/69001808329b8.jpg"},{"title":"Gentleman Thief Is Here!","synopsis":"Kamiya, a jewel thief, becomes intrigued by Hitomi and uses a bet with Ai to get close to her.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305354/screencap/6900181e86967.jpg"},{"title":"I Wish We Could Stay as We Are","synopsis":"Hitomi's role in Cat's Eye strains her relationship with Toshio, her lover and a detective.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305355/screencap/694ac2087542c.jpg"},{"title":"Stay Out of the Diary!","synopsis":"Though hesitant at first, the sisters let Toshio stay at Cat's Eye café.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305356/screencap/694eea8f17b83.jpg"},{"title":"Dad`s Self-Portrait","synopsis":"The sisters plan to stop Toshio's demotion by sending a fake heist notice to the police.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305357/screencap/695508143bd08.jpg"},{"title":"Get the Goddess of Mars","synopsis":"When Seguchi announces the display of \"The Goddess of Mars,\" Cat's Eye plots to steal the painting.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305358/screencap/696190b8f076d.jpg"},{"title":"First Date in a While","synopsis":"The Cat's Eye sisters infiltrate Toyo Foundation's remote island to recover their father's painting.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305359/screencap/69668fda0dd1a.jpg"},{"title":"An Invitation from Runan Island","synopsis":"Hitomi faces a grueling survival challenge on Toyo Foundation's island.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305360/screencap/6979203ac0c3a.jpg"},{"title":"The Promise of Sunset","synopsis":"Kaibara reveals Cat's Eye's true identity and demands they return all of Cranaff's paintings.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11305361/screencap/6978b57b8f7ab.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
